/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-20T20:33:13Z","updated_at":"2023-07-20T20:33:33Z","body":"Note that for the first level of nesting it works correctly:\r\nYB:\r\n```\r\nycqlsh:a> create type UDT1 (a int, b int);\r\nycqlsh:a> create table t4 (h int primary key, v UDT1);\r\nycqlsh:a> insert into t4 (h,v) values (1, {a:1, b:1});\r\nycqlsh:a> select v from t4;\r\n v\r\n--------------\r\n {a: 1, b: 1}\r\n(1 rows)\r\nycqlsh:a> select tojson(v) from t4;\r\n server_tojson(v)\r\n------------------\r\n    {\"a\":1,\"b\":1}        <<<< OK!\r\n(1 rows)\r\n```\r\nCassandra:\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:a> insert into t4 (h,v) values (1, {a:1, b:1});\r\ncqlsh:a> select v from t4;\r\n v\r\n--------------\r\n {a: 1, b: 1}\r\n(1 rows)\r\ncqlsh:a> select tojson(v) from t4;\r\n system.tojson(v)\r\n------------------\r\n {\"a\": 1, \"b\": 1}        <<< OK\r\n(1 rows)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1644565104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","g